-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E8%92%82%E5%B0%94%E8%BE%BE\" title=\"玛蒂尔达\"><img alt=\"玛蒂尔达\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E8%92%82%E5%B0%94%E8%BE%BE\" title=\"玛蒂尔达\">玛蒂尔达</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.3</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>南地漫游记</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：304103</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3041/304103/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3041/304103/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3041/304103/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3041/304103/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3041/304103/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3041/304103/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3041/304103/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3041/304103/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/57/Belonging-304104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">吉祥金铃<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Bell of Fortune</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />7.5<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条具有南亚风格的项链，镶嵌绿水晶、石榴石等多种宝石。<br />受访者原本并未打算买下它，直到宙哈里市场的摊主暗示，这条古董项链能够带来好运，实现心愿。<br />因此，她急匆匆地付出了一大把卢比。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1e/Belonging-304105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“轻装上路”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">«&#160;Matilda voyage léger&#160;!&#160;»</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />10.7<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一只便携挎包，圆柱形包身便于收纳水杯，也能容纳其他小物件。为了这次来之不易的旅行，受访者做了完善的准备。同龄人也许会让父母帮忙收拾行囊，而她只想要一句夸奖。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/67/Belonging-304106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">曼海蒂<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Mehndi</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>寄寓吉祥含义的传统手绘，染剂由天然植物制成，颜色可维持一周。<br />据受访者介绍，这是斋浦尔的一位神秘学家手绘师为她绘制的，植物纹样有着祈愿幸福的古老寓意，也能为占卜者带来更加清晰的视野。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 天才假日1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 天才假日2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">天才假日 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Genius's Holiday</small></span></span>"}}